# 8️⃣ Build Heap Complexity

A common misconception is:

```text
Build Heap = O(n log n)
```

But the optimized bottom-up Build Heap algorithm takes:

```text
O(n)
```

This is because most nodes are close to the bottom and require very little heapification.

Therefore:

```text
Build Heap → O(n)
```

